msgid "Email Log & Notifications"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: email-log-notifications.php
msgid ""
"A companion to your SMTP plugin: sends the email notifications (inquiry "
"notifications to the sales inbox, auto-confirmations back to the visitor in "
"their own language) and keeps a log of every send with its delivery result."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
#: email-log-notifications.php
msgid "kaisyuan-tseng"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: email-log-notifications.php
msgid "https://profiles.wordpress.org/kaisyuan-tseng/"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-eln-privacy.php:28
msgid ""
"This plugin stores inquiry data submitted through the site contact form: "
"name, email, message, form fields, browser language, timezone, IP address, "
"source page, and any uploaded attachments. Records are visible only to "
"authorized administrators and are used to send inquiry notifications and "
"delivery confirmations. Use the WordPress privacy tools to export or erase "
"records by email address; deleting an inquiry also removes its attachments."
msgstr ""

