msgid "Language group added."
msgstr "语言组已添加。"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:76
msgid "Language group deleted."
msgstr "语言组已删除。"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:77
msgid "That language group already exists."
msgstr "该语言组已存在。"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:78
msgid ""
"Matched against the visitor’s browser language ({{lang}}): full tag first "
"(zh-CN), then the primary language (zh). Anything unmatched uses the "
"“Default group” — the one template with no language attached."
msgstr ""
"按访客的浏览器语言（{{lang}}）匹配：先比完整标签（zh-CN），再比主语言（zh）；"
"都匹配不上就用「默认组」——它不分语言，是最后的兜底。"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:79
msgid ""
"These labels only affect {{rows}} in this language group. Leave empty to use "
"the wording the form itself submitted."
msgstr ""
"这里的标签只作用于当前语言组的 {{rows}}；留空则用前端表单提交时的措辞。"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:80
msgid "Used when the visitor’s browser language matches no language group"
msgstr "访客的浏览器语言没匹配到任何语言组时，发这一份"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:81
msgid "Drag to reorder"
msgstr "拖动排序"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:82
msgid ""
"Drag the handle to reorder — the table rows in {{rows}} follow this order."
msgstr "拖左侧手柄调整顺序——{{rows}} 的表格行就按这个顺序排。"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:83
msgid "Values marked * come from the front end:"
msgstr "带 * 的值需要前端提交："

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:84
msgid ""
"Every row of {{rows}} also comes from the submitted form fields — new form "
"fields show up here automatically."
msgstr ""
"{{rows}} 的每一行也来自前端表单的字段（表单加了新字段，这里会自动多一行）。"

